oonwu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://velog.io/@wijoonwu</a></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Finder</code>에서 톰캣이 설치된 경로로 접속합니다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>키보드에서 <code class=\"language-text\">command</code> + <code class=\"language-text\">option</code> + <code class=\"language-text\">c</code> 를 동시에 눌러 경로를 복사합니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/bbbf7/macbook-tomcat-08.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 70.83333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/a59e9/macbook-tomcat-08.webp 192w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/0ca9f/macbook-tomcat-08.webp 384w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/dc9b9/macbook-tomcat-08.webp 768w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/e2c2f/macbook-tomcat-08.webp 1152w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/94b1e/macbook-tomcat-08.webp 1280w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/3b721/macbook-tomcat-08.png 192w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/66595/macbook-tomcat-08.png 384w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/fe486/macbook-tomcat-08.png 768w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/d2d74/macbook-tomcat-08.png 1152w,\n/static/da0452e8c2f97f74c281320d323cdcb7/bbbf7/macbook-tomcat-08.png 1280w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100v